    '3.2 包邮或减免一般仅覆盖去程标准国际运费，不含关税、清关费、回程、仓储、销毁或二次派送；不符合活动条件的订单仍需支付运费。' => [
        'en_US' => '3.2 Free/reduced shipping usually covers outbound standard international freight only—not duties, clearance fees, returns, storage, destruction, or redelivery. Orders outside promotion rules still pay freight.',
        'en_GB' => '3.2 Free/reduced shipping usually covers outbound standard international freight only—not duties, clearance fees, returns, storage, destruction, or redelivery. Orders outside promotion rules still pay freight.',
        'ga_IE' => '3.2 Free/reduced shipping usually covers outbound standard international freight only—not duties, clearance fees, returns, storage, destruction, or redelivery. Orders outside promotion rules still pay freight.',
        'de_DE' => '3.2 Kostenloser/reduzierter Versand deckt in der Regel nur die normale Hinfracht international ab—nicht Zölle, Verzollung, Rücksendung, Lager, Vernichtung oder erneute Zustellung. Außerhalb der Aktion zahlen Sie Fracht.',
        'fr_FR' => '3.2 La livraison gratuite/réduite couvre en général uniquement le fret international standard aller—pas droits, frais de dédouanement, retours, stockage, destruction ou nouvelle livraison. Hors conditions promo, le fret reste dû.',
        'fr_CA' => '3.2 La livraison gratuite/réduite couvre en général uniquement le fret international standard aller—pas droits, frais de dédouanement, retours, stockage, destruction ou nouvelle livraison. Hors conditions promo, le fret reste dû.',
        'es_ES' => '3.2 El envío gratis/reducido suele cubrir solo el flete internacional estándar de ida—no aranceles, despacho, devoluciones, almacenamiento, destrucción ni reentrega. Fuera de la promo, el flete se paga.',
        'es_MX' => '3.2 El envío gratis/reducido suele cubrir solo el flete internacional estándar de ida—no aranceles, despacho, devoluciones, almacenamiento, destrucción ni reentrega. Fuera de la promo, el flete se paga.',
        'pt_BR' => '3.2 Frete grátis/reduzido costuma cobrir apenas o frete internacional padrão de ida—não direitos, desembaraço, devoluções, armazenamento, destruição ou reentrega. Fora da promo, o frete é devido.',
        'pt_PT' => '3.2 Frete grátis/reduzido costuma cobrir apenas o frete internacional padrão de ida—não direitos, desembaraço, devoluções, armazenamento, destruição ou reentrega. Fora da promo, o frete é devido.',
