    '6.3 因地址错误、拒收、无人签收或清关失败导致退回/销毁/二次配送的费用，由买家承担；退款时可扣除已产生费用。' => [
        'en_US' => '6.3 Costs from wrong address, refusal, no recipient, or failed clearance—including return/destruction/redelivery—are borne by the buyer and may be deducted from refunds.',
