    '6.1 运输丢失或严重破损：请提供订单号、运单号与照片。核实后我们协调承运商查件，并视情况补发或退款（可扣除已产生的不可回收费用）。' => [
        'en_US' => '6.1 Lost or severely damaged in transit: provide order/waybill numbers and photos. After verification we coordinate carrier tracing and may reship or refund (non-recoverable fees may be deducted).',
