    '6.4 不可抗力及跨境固有风险（海关查验、口岸拥堵、航班调整、疫情管制等）导致的延误，我们协助同步进度，但不构成服务质量违约，亦不自动触发退款。' => [
        'en_US' => '6.4 Delays from force majeure and inherent cross-border risks (customs, port congestion, flight changes, epidemic controls, etc.) are updated with our help but are not service breaches and do not auto-trigger refunds.',
        'en_GB' => '6.4 Delays from force majeure and inherent cross-border risks (customs, port congestion, flight changes, epidemic controls, etc.) are updated with our help but are not service breaches and do not auto-trigger refunds.',
